WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:03.000
Five agents. One repo. Chaos.

00:03.160 --> 00:05.600
Meet teamree, the ADE for teams.

00:05.800 --> 00:09.500
Every agent, its own worktree: Claude Code, Codex, side by side.

00:09.780 --> 00:12.700
One sidebar shows every task: working, asking, ready.

00:12.840 --> 00:15.100
Agents can even ask you, right from the CLI.

00:15.210 --> 00:18.600
Split it. Tab it. Answer it. ⌘-click any file to check its work.

00:18.760 --> 00:21.600
Host a relay. Send the link. Your team is live.

00:21.780 --> 00:25.850
Every teammate's agents in one sidebar. Spot the overlap before it's a conflict.

00:26.050 --> 00:28.500
Review live. Comments go straight to Claude Code.

00:28.730 --> 00:32.200
Ready to land? Land All. Fetched first, merged in order.

00:32.650 --> 00:34.700
Your whole team ships in parallel.

00:34.920 --> 00:37.400
teamree. Open source and free for all.
